{"item_id": "0276176101b28ee65684eaa19a648d615bc071d659c1da0134903b05c18fe6f8", "buckets": {"type": "问答题", "subject": "math-g9", "grade": "g9", "difficulty": "较难"}, "score_status": "scored", "correct": true, "extracted": "{\"score\": 1.0, \"marks\": [1, 1, 1], \"refs\": [\"4cm\", \"5cm\", \"9cm\"], \"student\": [\"4cm\", \"5cm\", \"9cm\"], \"unparsed\": false, \"judge_model\": \"MiniMax-M3\"}", "normalized": ["4cm", "5cm", "9cm"], "gold": ["4cm", "5cm", "9cm"], "response": "**解：** 由切线长定理，AF = AE，BF = BD，CD = CE。\n\n设 AF = AE = x，BF = BD = y，CD = CE = z，则：\n- x + y = AB = 9\n- y + z = BC = 14  \n- z + x = CA = 13\n\n三式相加得：2(x + y + z) = 36，即 x + y + z = 18\n\n解得：x = 4，y = 5，z = 9\n\n**答：AF = 4 cm，BD = 5 cm，CE = 9 cm。**", "item_score": 1.0, "n_blanks": 3, "unparsed": false, "judge_model": "MiniMax-M3"}
{"item_id": "03c5d9de3fe27f87e6f882f9e251863f7da673abedbfcb2bd5f9c6ab3104e9dd", "buckets": {"type": "填空题", "subject": "math-g9", "grade": "g9", "difficulty": "较易"}, "score_status": "scored", "correct": true, "extracted": "{\"score\": 1.0, \"marks\": [1], \"refs\": [\"左视图\"], \"student\": [\"左视图\"], \"unparsed\": false, \"judge_model\": \"MiniMax-M3\"}", "normalized": ["左视图"], "gold": ["左视图"], "response": "左视图", "item_score": 1.0, "n_blanks": 1, "unparsed": false, "judge_model": "MiniMax-M3"}
{"item_id": "03d1cf47217be49407b01a24c5010aa7167bab67fcfc3d71c23d3c983e09979e", "buckets": {"type": "问答题", "subject": "math-g9", "grade": "g9", "difficulty": "难"}, "score_status": "scored", "correct": true, "extracted": "{\"score\": 1.0, \"marks\": [1, 1], \"refs\": [\"-x$^{2}$+4x\", \"2\"], \"student\": [\"-x^2 + 4x\", \"2\"], \"unparsed\": false, \"judge_model\": \"MiniMax-M3\"}", "normalized": ["-x^2 + 4x", "2"], "gold": ["-x$^{2}$+4x", "2"], "response": "# 解答\n\n**建立坐标系：** 以B为原点，BC方向为x轴正方向，BA方向为y轴正方向。\n\n则 B(0,0)，C(4,0)，A(0,4)，D(4,4)\n\n**确定各点坐标：**\n- E在AB上，BE = x，所以 E(0, x)\n- F在AD延长线上，DF = x，所以 F(4+x, 4)\n- 由AEGF是矩形，得 G(4+x, x)\n- H在CD上，CH = x，所以 H(4, x)\n\n## (1) 求 y 与 x 的函数关系式\n\n四边形DHGF的顶点为：\n- D(4, 4)，H(4, x)，G(4+x, x)，F(4+x, 4)\n\n这是一个矩形，邻边长：\n- DH = 4 - x\n- HG = x\n\n$$y = x(4-x) = -x^2 + 4x$$\n\n由 0 < x < 4，得：\n\n$$\\boxed{y = -x^2 + 4x \\quad (0 < x < 4)}$$\n\n## (2) 求面积最大时BE的值\n\n将函数配方：\n$$y = -x^2 + 4x = -(x-2)^2 + 4$$\n\n当 x = 2 时，y 取得最大值，最大值为 4。\n\n$$\\boxed{当 BE = 2 时，四边形DHGF的面积最大，最大面积为 4}$$", "item_score": 1.0, "n_blanks": 2, "unparsed": false, "judge_model": "MiniMax-M3"}
